A new data file is opened without O_EXCL, so a reused name reopens a live
file instead of panicking, and its appends land where recovery does not look.
Reverts #35.
Guarded-by: "createDataFileForWrite panics when the data file already exists"

diff --git a/bytecaskdb/data_file.cppm b/bytecaskdb/data_file.cppm
index 60dfeeaa..9c4bbd96 100644
